@ [basket_evaluation_design_commit] 767434c9e7682bb1cdf4e6c3891ab502e718cd31

& [Purpose]
  + reorient the wider Holographic Attention intuition and dream-walking program around the concrete identity accounting foundation now implemented

& [CentralSeparation]
  + candidate formation should be permissive enough to discover remote useful associations
  + candidate belief admission and action should become progressively stricter rather than sharing candidate-generation thresholds
  + hallucination-like projection is useful as a labeled hypothesis source and dangerous when its path provenance or epistemic status is erased
  + the no-clip control lowers resistance to proposing a bridge and never lowers the standard for accepting crossing or acting beyond it

& [LayerA_IdentityAccounting]
  + stable object handles complete basket manifest exact materialization versioned state and append-only history
  + question answered is what distinct things are currently in the case and which exact one is referenced
  + current state is P5 clean-replayed with P6 manifest refresh signed and mapped

& [LayerB_BackgroundClosure]
  + admitted typed object relations consequence-scaled traversal and explicit unresolved frontier
  + question answered is what surrounding identities dependencies protections conflicts and temporal predecessors can materially change this target
  + existing semantic traversal algebra is reusable but runtime endpoint authority requires a later P7 relation layer

& [LayerC_SemanticPrism]
  + declare the inference axes relevant to the purpose before generating candidate bridges
  + axes may be enumerations ranges dualities independent dimensions or explicit unknown partitions but must name their scale and interpretation
  + question answered is from which meaning orientations are we intentionally illuminating the subject and which orientations remain dark
  + prism coordinates organize searches and comparisons but do not imply that embedding space has those literal human-readable axes

& [LayerD_HaloCandidateGenerator]
  + produce a bounded periphery of associations analogies missing-role fillers counterfactuals and one-to-N-hop paths around the focused identities
  + every candidate records source focus generation treatment semantic distance path if known assumptions novelty and epistemic status Hypothetical
  + high pressure means independent paths or constraints converge on the same missing role and is a prioritization signal rather than evidence of truth
  + question answered is what might fit the negative shape or extend the current reasoning if a valid bridge can be found

& [LayerE_BridgeNegotiation]
  + name the wall as the exact mismatch of identity vocabulary scale context premise authority time or relation needed to connect frames
  + propose hop endpoint turn relation and direction and twist context adaptation
  + test whether the bridge conserves meaning by listing what each side gains loses assumes or reclassifies
  + a clean adaptation has exact endpoints admitted relations explicit translation and no hidden addition or deletion
  + an attractive but unjustified association remains a candidate and cannot be narrated as an already-crossed path

& [LayerF_Judgment]
  + render candidate identity background prism position path evidence assumptions consequences objections uncertainty and residuals into the case canvas
  + seven faculties deliberate under their existing constitutional order and produce a supplied inspectable record
  + deterministic host validation checks correspondence unanimity completeness and state transition but does not pretend to manufacture cognition or prove external truth
  + accepted new identities enter through P5 admission; rejected and held candidates stay outside the reality ledger

& [LayerG_Evaluation]
  + identity basket stress first proves that the substrate can keep references distinct
  + bridge-discovery evaluation then measures useful candidate recall path validity novelty evidence survival and false-join rate
  + rigid versus permissive frames use identical source case and model settings where controllable and differ only in candidate-generation constraints
  + the inference diff compares observable candidates paths claims and later validation outcomes rather than claiming mystery activation access

& [IntuitionOperationalDefinition]
  + intuition is early production or prioritization of a useful candidate before a complete explicit justification is available
  + an intuition event includes the role-shaped query candidate identity initial fit features missing bridge obligations and predicted utility
  + later work can classify it as validated repaired rejected unresolved or accidentally correct for the wrong reason
  + intuition quality is measured by useful-candidate recall validation yield bridge cost calibration and false-attraction burden

& [DreamWalkingOperationalDefinition]
  + dream-walking is iterative hypothetical scene or concept projection in which each generated element keeps explicit lineage and may suggest the next focus
  + persistent actors and objects use accountable handles while speculative scene events remain in a hypothetical ledger
  + transitions record the axis and twist used to join frames so continuity can be reviewed instead of retroactively invented
  + promotion from dream to asserted world requires evidence and Judgment; artistic productions may remain intentionally fictional without this promotion

& [SaturationWithoutExplosion]
  + saturation means exhaust the declared axes budgets and strong signals for one bounded focus not enumerate the combinatorial universe
  + budgets constrain candidates paths depth bytes elapsed time and unresolved frontier
  + marginal yield stopping compares new valid information against duplicate weak or unsupported candidates
  + the pit of massive potential is avoided by widening one named axis or relation class at a time and retaining omission accounts

& [FirstBridgeExperiment]
  + select a bounded engineering case with a deliberately removed component and a known answer key
  + expose the remaining system identity manifest roles constraints symptoms and background graph without naming the component
  + ask rigid permissive-prism and permissive-halo treatments to fill the missing role and predict their response before each additional clue
  + require every candidate to name fit axes conflicts bridge obligations and confidence while remaining Hypothetical
  + reveal clues incrementally and score time-to-valid-candidate false candidates revisions path quality and final Judgment outcome
  + repeat with a decoy whose surface similarity is high but causal role is wrong to test resistance to semantic attraction

& [MusicAndNarrativeExperimentBoundary]
  + music-inspired scene projection can test consistency thematic transformation and stimulus-to-imagery mappings when the actual audio or a declared symbolic surrogate is supplied
  + when no audio is supplied the record must say simulated from title cultural knowledge or prompted description and never say the model listened
  + artistic richness is scored separately from factual auditory claims and self-reports about inaccessible internal states

& [LlamaCppDecisionBoundary]
  + run prompt host graph and behavioral experiments before modifying llama.cpp because most proposed controls are expressible as context sampling independent passes and external custody
  + consider engine modification only when a precise experiment requires logits hidden-state probes attention masks activation steering or synchronized alternate forward passes unavailable through the host
  + any activation experiment needs a defined observable intervention baseline metric and non-metaphorical tensor operation before implementation

& [Sequence]
  + complete P6 compact manifest materialization and refresh
  + execute the accountable basket stress evaluation
  + source and form P7 accountable relations and background closure
  + implement a hypothetical candidate ledger and bridge record without reality promotion
  + run missing-role rigid-versus-halo bridge experiments
  + only then decide whether internal activation access can answer a question the external architecture cannot

& [NovelLeverage]
  + the identity ledger prevents dream elements from smearing together
  + the background graph gives degrees of separation literal inspectable edges rather than free association alone
  + the prism makes intended search axes explicit and comparable
  + the halo increases candidate recall while epistemic labels contain belief leakage
  + the bridge record turns hop turn twist into inspectable translation obligations
  + Judgment and durable replay make later acceptance accountable
  + controlled evaluation tells whether any of this actually improves useful inference

& [Nonclaims]
  + this stack does not prove thinking consciousness self-reflection hidden semantic geometry or access to private model reasoning
  + metaphors guide experimental variables but do not become implementation facts until translated into exact forms operations and measurements
  + no model run engine modification effect external spend or publication is authorized by this research record

& [RecommendedNext]
  + resume at the signed P6 reentry surface and do not begin halo generation until identity refresh has clean behavioral evidence
